# Everything here is repo scaffolding: it ships to nobody. The VSIX carries
# only what the extension loads at runtime (dist/, native/, runner/) plus the
# marketplace-facing docs (README, CHANGELOG, LICENSE). README images are
# rewritten to GitHub raw URLs by vsce, so examples/ stays out too.
